WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:32.560
Fellow citizens of Yizhou,

01:33.080 --> 01:35.200
tribute brocade is a rare treasure
favored by the Emperor,

01:35.280 --> 01:37.640
the hard work of all the silk weavers,

01:37.720 --> 01:39.560
and the pride of Yizhou.

01:40.160 --> 01:41.840
Now it has been tarnished
by villainous men,

01:41.920 --> 01:43.320
bringing shame to all of Yizhou.

01:43.960 --> 01:46.280
Shouldn't he give us an explanation?

01:46.360 --> 01:47.760
Yes!

01:47.840 --> 01:49.760
We deserve an explanation!

01:49.840 --> 01:52.920
General Niu, please investigate this
and stand for the people!

01:59.320 --> 02:01.040
No matter how high
General Niu's military law is,

02:01.120 --> 02:02.680
it cannot surpass that of His Majesty,

02:02.760 --> 02:04.040
nor the will of the people.

02:09.080 --> 02:12.760
General Niu, please investigate this
and stand for the people!

02:15.600 --> 02:16.680
Father,

02:16.760 --> 02:18.440
the family
of the Logistics Officer is in my hands.

02:18.520 --> 02:20.320
He wouldn't dare to speak recklessly.

02:27.920 --> 02:30.800
You scoundrel,
as a soldier of the Tang Empire,

02:31.840 --> 02:34.800
you don't think about
how to protect the people of Yizhou,

02:35.760 --> 02:38.840
instead, you spend your days
on petty, disgraceful schemes!

02:38.920 --> 02:41.400
Ending up in such a fate is well-deserved.

02:42.160 --> 02:46.040
Rest assured,
as long as you confess the truth,

02:46.120 --> 02:49.360
your family will be
taken care of by the army.

02:50.480 --> 02:51.600
Go in peace!

02:51.680 --> 02:53.760
Live a clean life in your next life.

03:07.800 --> 03:09.840
Yang Jinglan won't come to harm, right?

03:10.880 --> 03:13.520
He's always been strategic,
quick-witted in action.

03:14.160 --> 03:15.160
He should be fine.

03:17.200 --> 03:19.800
Then, please, Mr. Zhuge,
take him to the Brocade Bureau.

03:20.400 --> 03:21.240
And you?

03:22.240 --> 03:23.080
I'll wait for him.

03:24.480 --> 03:25.320
Alright.

03:28.520 --> 03:29.840
Take him back to the Brocade Bureau!

04:18.320 --> 04:22.680
PEACE AND PROSPERITY

05:42.040 --> 05:43.440
You were worried

05:43.520 --> 05:46.400
that Niu Jin's soldiers
might disturb Yizhou,

05:46.480 --> 05:48.080
so you came back late?

05:49.720 --> 05:52.160
The person who knows me best
is you, Ms. Ji.

05:54.400 --> 05:55.560
Congratulations.

05:55.640 --> 05:57.280
Your father is finally cleared of guilt.

05:57.960 --> 05:59.320
From now on,

05:59.400 --> 06:01.240
you will no longer be
the daughter of a criminal.

06:01.320 --> 06:04.800
Your father
is still the righteous Brocade Master.

06:07.280 --> 06:08.360
What about you?

06:08.960 --> 06:09.920
Me?

06:12.200 --> 06:13.640
Did I handle this well?

06:14.600 --> 06:16.160
Were you hurt?

06:20.880 --> 06:21.760
Not at all.

06:26.800 --> 06:27.760
That's good.

06:31.560 --> 06:32.560
That's good.

06:42.720 --> 06:44.120
It's all thanks to you

06:45.960 --> 06:47.560
that I have a home to return to.

07:46.920 --> 07:48.880
Everyone sees the world in their own way.

07:50.720 --> 07:52.320
You can watch it through a kite.

07:52.400 --> 07:53.520
The further you want to see,

07:53.600 --> 07:55.040
the farther it will fly!

07:58.200 --> 07:59.960
You look nice when you smile.

08:00.680 --> 08:01.720
You should smile more often.

08:03.640 --> 08:05.360
You always used to say,

08:05.440 --> 08:08.720
"The person
who knows me best is Mr. Zhao."

08:08.800 --> 08:10.080
But now,

08:10.160 --> 08:13.520
you and he have become
one in mind, life and death, together.

08:38.200 --> 08:40.200
But is he really a good person?

08:41.919 --> 08:43.880
I helped him with all my heart,

08:44.720 --> 08:46.000
without fearing for my life.

08:46.080 --> 08:48.160
I entered Chang'an with him,

08:49.240 --> 08:50.640
yet he deceived me.

08:52.840 --> 08:54.960
I only wanted you.

08:56.200 --> 08:57.400
Is that too greedy?

08:58.320 --> 08:59.440
Too much to ask?

09:15.120 --> 09:17.720
Did you already know
Yang Jinglan's scheme?

09:18.680 --> 09:20.960
Traveling thousands of miles
to Chang'an with him,

09:22.080 --> 09:25.800
don't you care about
the lives of the Zhao family?

09:25.880 --> 09:27.640
Who is Yang Jinglan, really?

09:27.720 --> 09:29.440
You can't even handle him.

09:29.520 --> 09:31.240
He forced me to go to Chang'an.

09:31.840 --> 09:33.080
What could I do?

09:35.480 --> 09:37.680
If my father abandons me,

09:37.760 --> 09:39.600
you won't escape either.

09:40.440 --> 09:43.200
Clearly, it was your hasty actions
that led to things being exposed,

09:43.280 --> 09:44.720
tying yourself in knots.

09:45.800 --> 09:48.440
I am just a pawn in your Niu family.

09:48.520 --> 09:50.240
How could I change the overall situation?

09:52.760 --> 09:55.080
Don't think I don't know
what you're thinking.

09:55.920 --> 09:57.960
You're trying to use this situation

09:58.040 --> 10:01.320
to assist Yang Jinglan
and please Ji Yingying.

10:02.520 --> 10:05.080
Your calculations are probably wrong.

10:06.200 --> 10:08.440
Look at the state they're in now.

10:09.120 --> 10:10.720
Do you think there's room for anyone else?

10:12.520 --> 10:15.440
I'm afraid you'll be the one

10:15.520 --> 10:17.600
who ends up caught in the middle.

10:24.440 --> 10:26.280
Instead of arguing here,

10:26.360 --> 10:27.400
why not think about

10:28.280 --> 10:29.920
how to calm your father's anger?

10:30.720 --> 10:32.240
Although I don't mind being a widower.

10:40.520 --> 10:42.880
You may be happy too early.

10:44.120 --> 10:45.880
You think capturing the Logistics Officer

10:45.960 --> 10:47.880
will bring my father down?

10:48.560 --> 10:51.640
Do you think I will just sit back and die?

10:52.760 --> 10:54.640
Today, in the Long Street,

10:55.240 --> 10:58.920
dare he speak recklessly
about a word between me and my father?

11:01.400 --> 11:02.240
What have you done?

11:07.400 --> 11:09.760
Between the all-powerful General Niu

11:09.840 --> 11:12.120
and a mere Brocade Officer of Yizhou,

11:13.360 --> 11:14.440
how should one choose?

11:15.440 --> 11:17.000
Isn't it obvious?

11:24.440 --> 11:27.600
She's so certain
that the Logistics Officer won't speak.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.720
There's only one reason…

11:36.160 --> 11:39.200
As you expected,
there's no real evidence at his home.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.400
But in these stolen goods,

11:41.480 --> 11:44.760
there are a few special items
hidden among the others.

11:46.120 --> 11:47.160
These…

11:48.080 --> 11:49.240
What's wrong with them?

11:50.880 --> 11:53.160
- They're all from Nanzhao?
- Yes.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.880
Looking at the design,

11:55.960 --> 11:57.960
they must be for the royal family
or nobles to use.

12:04.240 --> 12:08.840
My master came to Yizhou
shortly after traveling through Nanzhao.

12:13.120 --> 12:15.800
The Logistics Officer has been helping
Niu Jin smuggle tribute brocade.

12:17.240 --> 12:19.520
In your opinion, where would they sell it?

12:26.120 --> 12:29.560
Go and verify
whether these are real goods,

12:30.240 --> 12:31.560
what year they're from,

12:31.640 --> 12:34.080
and which Nanzhao
noble or royal family prefers them.

12:34.160 --> 12:35.160
Understood.

12:36.040 --> 12:37.000
Wait.

12:41.280 --> 12:42.680
Have you found
the Logistics Officer's family?

12:42.760 --> 12:44.000
Not yet.

12:44.080 --> 12:46.240
They might have heard the news
and fled early,

12:46.920 --> 12:49.000
or they were caught by Niu Jin's men.

12:49.080 --> 12:51.280
Whether they escaped or were caught,

12:51.360 --> 12:54.480
as long as they
are not safely delivered to him,

12:54.560 --> 12:55.960
he won't dare
to point the finger at Niu Jin.

12:58.320 --> 12:59.400
Keep investigating.

12:59.480 --> 13:02.200
If they are in Niu Jin's hands,

13:03.320 --> 13:04.600
inform Gao and others,

13:04.680 --> 13:06.400
and let them find a way to rescue them!

13:07.000 --> 13:07.880
Yes.

13:41.520 --> 13:42.400
You've been running around so much.

13:42.480 --> 13:44.080
Have you not slept for days and nights?

13:45.480 --> 13:46.600
Sleep?

13:47.320 --> 13:50.040
Don't you know
there's a skill that allows you

13:50.120 --> 13:51.160
to sleep like this?

13:57.760 --> 14:00.760
I once thought
that you were just a spoiled guy,

14:00.840 --> 14:01.880
good for nothing.

14:02.400 --> 14:03.640
But it's fine.

14:03.720 --> 14:06.360
After all, I once thought
you were just a profit-driven person,

14:06.440 --> 14:07.280
unambitious.

14:08.280 --> 14:10.160
Otherwise, how could we be future friends?

14:15.960 --> 14:17.560
Come, future friends, get up.

14:18.880 --> 14:20.000
What is it?

14:20.080 --> 14:22.080
I command you to go to sleep now.

14:22.160 --> 14:23.280
I'll come back a little later.

14:23.360 --> 14:24.320
Go.

14:25.200 --> 14:27.200
Right now,
my mind is full of trivial matters.

14:27.280 --> 14:30.600
And this command of yours
doesn't quite make sense.

14:30.680 --> 14:31.920
Can I ignore it?

14:32.720 --> 14:35.160
No, you cannot. My command must be obeyed.

14:35.240 --> 14:37.200
Mr. Yang,
Mr. Zhao Xiuyuan requests an audience.

14:51.800 --> 14:53.520
I'm here because I want an explanation.

14:53.600 --> 14:55.960
Did you two already plan

14:57.360 --> 14:59.920
to send the Logistics Officer
back to Yizhou?

15:02.440 --> 15:03.440
The fewer people

15:04.400 --> 15:06.000
know about this, the safer it is.

15:07.280 --> 15:08.280
I didn't tell you

15:10.280 --> 15:11.800
because I was afraid you'd leak it.

15:12.720 --> 15:14.200
Afraid I'd leak it?

15:14.280 --> 15:15.200
To Niu Jin?

15:20.560 --> 15:21.680
Yingying,

15:22.400 --> 15:25.200
I went with him to escort
the prisoner to Chang'an,

15:25.280 --> 15:26.880
not daring to rest for a moment,

15:27.880 --> 15:30.080
just to clear your father's name,

15:30.160 --> 15:31.400
to eliminate Niu Jin,

15:31.480 --> 15:32.400
and to protect your safety!

15:34.760 --> 15:36.760
And now, you both don't trust me.

15:37.920 --> 15:39.080
You treat me like a spy.

15:39.760 --> 15:40.640
You treat me like a joke.

15:42.480 --> 15:44.000
It's not that I don't trust you,

15:44.600 --> 15:47.560
but I can't take even the slightest risk
in my father's case.

15:48.680 --> 15:51.040
Moreover, we never
discussed things in detail.

15:51.120 --> 15:52.440
It's mostly been reacting to situations.

15:52.520 --> 15:54.520
So, I couldn't inform you in advance.

15:54.600 --> 15:55.840
Reacting to situations?

15:59.120 --> 16:00.080
You two

16:01.280 --> 16:03.040
truly think alike.

16:09.440 --> 16:11.200
The Logistics Officer
is in your hands, right?

16:11.280 --> 16:12.120
I want to see him.

16:12.200 --> 16:14.080
The Logistics Officer
is an important witness.

16:14.840 --> 16:16.280
His safety comes first.

16:17.360 --> 16:19.720
I can't just bring anyone to see him.

16:19.800 --> 16:22.280
With you two watching from the side,
how could I possibly harm him?

16:22.880 --> 16:24.080
Don't worry.

16:24.160 --> 16:26.560
I'll just ask him a few questions
from a distance.

16:27.240 --> 16:28.480
How he answers

16:28.560 --> 16:31.080
will tell you whether
I'm with Niu Jin's people or not!

16:33.160 --> 16:36.440
Yingying, from the moment
I went to Chang'an with him,

16:37.760 --> 16:39.920
I've been a thorn in Niu Jin's side.

16:41.080 --> 16:43.840
If you still don't trust me or protect me,

16:46.040 --> 16:47.960
when you see me again in a few days,

16:51.040 --> 16:52.360
it might be my corpse you see.

17:06.200 --> 17:07.280
Promise me

17:08.280 --> 17:09.440
you won't get too close to the prisoner.

17:34.240 --> 17:36.680
Zhao Xiuyuan, you dare come?

17:38.080 --> 17:39.560
You're Niu Jin's son-in-law.

17:39.640 --> 17:41.280
Are my family in your hands?

17:41.360 --> 17:43.080
You know who I am,

17:43.160 --> 17:44.400
and yet you still dare to be so arrogant?

17:47.440 --> 17:48.480
Let me ask you.

17:49.720 --> 17:52.200
Who made you swap the tribute brocade?

17:53.160 --> 17:54.520
Was it Niu Wuniang?

17:55.800 --> 17:57.280
I was there at the inn too.

17:57.880 --> 18:01.840
Do you know
that while you framed Yang Jinglan,

18:01.920 --> 18:03.480
you put me in an inescapable position?

18:04.160 --> 18:06.800
As long as Yang Jinglan
is convicted and executed,

18:07.680 --> 18:09.680
she doesn't care about your fate.

18:12.280 --> 18:14.320
Why didn't she tell me the plan?

18:15.120 --> 18:17.080
She doesn't trust you at all.

18:17.680 --> 18:20.200
She said that for Ji Yingying,

18:20.880 --> 18:22.440
you would do anything!

18:31.280 --> 18:32.200
Yes,

18:35.000 --> 18:37.680
I am someone whom no one trusts.

18:44.640 --> 18:46.120
You should be grateful.

18:46.920 --> 18:48.520
Although I'm Niu Jin's son-in-law,

18:48.600 --> 18:51.280
I didn't come here on his orders.

18:51.360 --> 18:54.400
Otherwise, you would have to die
to pay for your sins.

18:59.760 --> 19:01.000
You!

19:01.600 --> 19:03.240
Even when I'm down and out,

19:03.320 --> 19:05.440
it's not your place to humiliate me!

19:06.040 --> 19:07.080
Let go!

19:15.240 --> 19:17.520
Listen carefully and see clearly now?

19:21.200 --> 19:23.360
Have I cleared my name?

19:39.720 --> 19:40.840
I deceived him.

19:41.680 --> 19:42.840
I didn't trust him.

19:44.320 --> 19:46.800
It has nothing to do with you.
You don't need to feel guilty.

19:47.760 --> 19:49.520
I'm just a bit saddened.

19:50.560 --> 19:52.520
He never intended to harm me,

19:52.600 --> 19:54.120
and I have no regrets.

19:55.120 --> 19:57.800
But now, we doubt each other.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.080
We're like strangers.

20:00.000 --> 20:01.040
Life is long.

20:01.120 --> 20:03.360
Some people can only
accompany you for a while.

20:03.440 --> 20:04.720
Only those with the same goals

20:04.800 --> 20:06.680
will walk together for the long haul.

20:06.760 --> 20:08.080
They are the true companions.

20:20.840 --> 20:22.840
Companion, I should go home now.

20:22.920 --> 20:24.680
We can no longer walk together.

20:35.160 --> 20:36.000
It's fine.

20:40.040 --> 20:40.960
There's plenty of time ahead.

21:17.280 --> 21:18.200
Yingying,

21:19.160 --> 21:20.120
there's something

21:21.280 --> 21:22.400
I want to say to you.

21:39.360 --> 21:40.360
Mr. Zhao,

21:41.960 --> 21:45.920
I think we are no longer
suited to be here.

21:47.640 --> 21:48.600
Yingying,

21:49.720 --> 21:51.120
when you weren't around,

21:52.240 --> 21:54.120
I often sat here, lost in thought,

21:55.560 --> 21:58.480
thinking about everything
we've been through.

21:59.560 --> 22:01.400
It really feels like a lifetime ago.

22:02.840 --> 22:03.760
These scenes,

22:04.360 --> 22:06.720
even after ten or 20 years,

22:06.800 --> 22:08.120
won't change.

22:09.760 --> 22:11.440
But between people,

22:12.200 --> 22:13.960
things have already changed
beyond recognition.

22:17.960 --> 22:19.200
Today, I come here

22:20.200 --> 22:22.120
to sincerely apologize to you

22:22.880 --> 22:24.160
and to explain

22:25.120 --> 22:26.600
everything that's happened in these days.

22:26.680 --> 22:29.520
At that time,
Niu Wuniang forced me with your life.

22:30.400 --> 22:32.360
That's why I married her.

22:32.440 --> 22:34.720
The matter of Shu Red Silk

22:34.800 --> 22:36.160
wasn't voluntary on my part.

22:37.600 --> 22:38.720
But now,

22:39.600 --> 22:41.120
I've gained some power,

22:42.360 --> 22:45.000
and I can protect you in my own way.

22:46.520 --> 22:48.040
What you say now

22:50.200 --> 22:51.120
is already too late.

22:51.200 --> 22:52.080
It's not too late.

22:52.680 --> 22:54.040
With my tireless efforts,

22:54.120 --> 22:55.760
Niu Wuniang has been repeatedly defeated.

22:56.640 --> 22:58.680
She has already lost Niu Jin's trust.

22:58.760 --> 23:01.320
And on Niu Jin's side,
I've found his weakness.

23:01.400 --> 23:02.520
He dares not act rashly!

23:03.880 --> 23:04.720
Yingying,

23:05.600 --> 23:06.480
the time has come.

23:07.240 --> 23:08.840
We can start over!

23:15.840 --> 23:16.760
Xiuyuan,

23:17.960 --> 23:20.640
I'm grateful for everything
you've done for me.

23:21.840 --> 23:24.400
I don't want to dwell on the mistakes
you've made anymore.

23:26.640 --> 23:28.800
I just hope you can turn over a new leaf

23:29.360 --> 23:30.760
and be yourself again.

23:32.320 --> 23:34.360
Become that clear

23:34.440 --> 23:36.440
and upright Zhao Xiuyuan.

23:39.400 --> 23:40.520
As for us,

23:42.240 --> 23:43.840
let the past be the past.

23:50.600 --> 23:51.600
The past is over?

23:52.720 --> 23:53.600
But how can it be over?

23:56.680 --> 23:57.800
Because of you,

23:58.760 --> 24:00.560
I endured humiliation and hardship

24:00.640 --> 24:02.640
and became what I am now,

24:03.680 --> 24:06.000
a pawn in Niu Wuniang's game.

24:06.080 --> 24:07.480
Because of you,

24:07.560 --> 24:09.600
I became a despicable person!

24:09.680 --> 24:10.680
Because of you,

24:10.760 --> 24:13.280
I became the laughingstock of everyone!

24:14.120 --> 24:15.120
How can I move on?

24:15.880 --> 24:17.960
You said you did it for my good,

24:18.040 --> 24:20.720
but did you ever ask me what I wanted?

24:21.320 --> 24:23.200
I don't want a man who thinks
he knows what's best for me

24:23.280 --> 24:25.280
and abandons me without consent.

24:27.200 --> 24:29.040
What I want is someone
who will brave the storm with me,

24:29.120 --> 24:30.560
and someone who will
walk hand in hand with me.

24:31.880 --> 24:33.080
Zhao Xiuyuan,

24:33.160 --> 24:34.640
let's end it here.

24:37.120 --> 24:38.080
Stop right there!

24:41.680 --> 24:43.200
I just want to ask you one question.

24:45.160 --> 24:46.480
Have you fallen in love with Yang Jinglan?

24:47.680 --> 24:48.720
It's none of your business.

24:53.360 --> 24:54.800
I knew it.

24:54.880 --> 24:56.040
I knew it!

24:57.200 --> 24:58.400
At first, I thought,

24:59.040 --> 25:00.480
as long as you're safe,

25:00.560 --> 25:03.920
I would accept any grievance!

25:05.760 --> 25:09.160
But when I saw you two
getting closer and closer,

25:11.920 --> 25:13.400
I realized I couldn't accept it.

25:15.280 --> 25:16.720
I'm not that generous!

25:22.640 --> 25:23.720
Alright…

25:24.920 --> 25:26.000
Enough…

25:27.080 --> 25:28.640
Let's not bring this up anymore.
Let's not talk about it.

25:29.280 --> 25:30.760
I'm sorry.

25:30.840 --> 25:31.680
I shouldn't have lost my temper with you.

25:33.360 --> 25:34.280
Just give me some time.

25:34.920 --> 25:36.760
Yingying, recently,

25:36.840 --> 25:38.280
please don't meet
with Yang Jinglan, alright?

25:38.880 --> 25:41.320
Give me some time.
I'll figure something out.

25:42.680 --> 25:43.800
I'll definitely find a way.
There will be a way.

25:44.400 --> 25:45.240
Just give me some time.

25:45.320 --> 25:46.800
- Believe in me, alright?
- Let go of me.

25:46.880 --> 25:48.160
I'll definitely think of a way.

25:48.240 --> 25:49.840
- Let go of me.
- Yingying, I have a way!

25:49.920 --> 25:51.120
- Let go of me!
- I'll figure it out.

25:51.720 --> 25:53.400
You're hurting me.

25:53.480 --> 25:54.520
Let go of me!

25:56.240 --> 25:57.160
Zhao Xiuyuan,

25:57.720 --> 25:59.800
there's no possibility
between you and me anymore!

26:09.200 --> 26:10.040
Who are you?

26:10.120 --> 26:11.280
What are you doing? Let go of me…

26:19.080 --> 26:19.920
He's dead.

26:20.000 --> 26:21.480
What happened?

26:22.160 --> 26:23.200
He committed suicide.

26:36.280 --> 26:37.120
Did anyone come in?

26:38.520 --> 26:40.560
Not long after Zhao Xiuyuan left,
he committed suicide.

26:42.120 --> 26:43.000
Zhao Xiuyuan?

27:01.480 --> 27:02.440
Who are you?

27:03.200 --> 27:05.360
Why are you locked
in my family's storehouse?

27:09.160 --> 27:10.160
Please, Master, have mercy.

27:10.240 --> 27:11.560
Let us out.

27:12.120 --> 27:13.960
You must tell me, who are you,

27:14.600 --> 27:16.120
and why are you here?

27:16.200 --> 27:17.080
So I can let you go.

27:17.160 --> 27:19.920
My husband is under
the Military Commissioner's command.

27:20.000 --> 27:23.200
He is Du Yu, the logistics officer
escorting the tribute brocade.

27:23.800 --> 27:25.960
I don't know what happened.

27:26.040 --> 27:27.640
We were suddenly held here.

27:27.720 --> 27:30.360
Uncle, please,

27:30.440 --> 27:32.720
save my father.

27:32.800 --> 27:34.000
Please!

27:36.000 --> 27:37.080
You must trade your life

27:37.160 --> 27:38.640
for your family's lives.

27:50.080 --> 27:51.680
Why did Zhao Xiuyuan do this?

27:53.640 --> 27:55.240
Who wants the logistics officer
dead the most?

27:57.000 --> 27:57.880
Niu Jin.

28:03.360 --> 28:04.200
Where are you going?

28:04.280 --> 28:05.960
If he's going to side with Niu Jin,

28:06.040 --> 28:07.520
it's only for one person.

28:25.680 --> 28:28.840
THE ZHAO RESIDENCE

28:59.440 --> 29:02.040
KITCHEN GOD'S TABLET

29:04.360 --> 29:05.440
You're awake.

29:15.160 --> 29:17.880
Do you know how long I've waited
for this day?

29:21.640 --> 29:25.160
From the time you took me away
from the Zhao's courtyard,

29:25.240 --> 29:27.280
took me to play and took me to fly kites,

29:27.360 --> 29:28.720
I swore

29:29.800 --> 29:31.200
I would stay with you for life.

29:42.960 --> 29:45.760
Offering livestock,
may you bless us with prosperous herds.

29:52.520 --> 29:55.520
Offering fresh spring water,
may you bless us with endless prosperity.

29:59.920 --> 30:00.880
Actually,

30:01.800 --> 30:04.200
I'm not that attached to this world.

30:04.800 --> 30:05.800
It was you

30:06.840 --> 30:08.920
who took me away
from the Zhao's courtyard.

30:10.320 --> 30:12.040
I followed your footsteps,

30:13.120 --> 30:15.760
walking farther and farther,
going even farther.

30:17.240 --> 30:18.960
But now, when I turn back,

30:21.320 --> 30:22.360
you're gone.

30:23.440 --> 30:25.000
You left me all alone here!

30:28.560 --> 30:30.640
It's like you've thrown that boy

30:32.160 --> 30:35.480
back into that lifeless courtyard.

30:38.320 --> 30:40.400
Like a kite that has soared with the wind,

30:41.640 --> 30:43.560
how could it

30:44.480 --> 30:46.080
willingly return to stillness?

30:49.120 --> 30:50.600
So, I must catch this wind.

30:52.240 --> 30:53.640
I must stay with this wind

30:55.080 --> 30:56.240
forever.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.440
Kitchen God, please witness this.

31:04.280 --> 31:05.120
Today,

31:06.520 --> 31:09.480
Ji Yingying and I are happily married.

31:10.040 --> 31:12.720
We will weather the storms together,
never to part!

31:30.800 --> 31:32.440
After drinking this cup of marriage wine,

31:34.400 --> 31:36.000
you and I are officially husband and wife.

31:47.000 --> 31:48.160
Drink it.

31:51.240 --> 31:52.240
I'm sorry.

31:53.080 --> 31:54.000
I forgot that you can't move.

31:55.240 --> 31:56.440
Let me feed you.

32:11.960 --> 32:12.840
Don't cry.

32:14.040 --> 32:15.520
I, Zhao Xiuyuan, swear

32:16.800 --> 32:18.160
I will never betray you.

32:25.000 --> 32:25.840
Zhao Xiuyuan,

32:33.080 --> 32:34.520
between you and me,

32:36.600 --> 32:38.640
there isn't even any hatred anymore.

33:38.120 --> 33:38.960
Yang Jinglan.

33:42.720 --> 33:44.120
Take me away from here.

35:05.000 --> 35:06.520
I can't go home.

35:11.480 --> 35:12.320
Alright.

35:59.560 --> 36:00.400
Yang Jinglan.

36:02.160 --> 36:03.000
I'm here.

36:04.480 --> 36:05.400
I'm hungry.

36:07.720 --> 36:10.040
Alright, I'll go get you something to eat.

36:10.680 --> 36:11.720
Wait here for me.

37:37.480 --> 37:38.800
Dear, no need to look.

37:39.400 --> 37:41.760
I've already sent your people away.

37:50.840 --> 37:51.800
Today is a day of great joy.

37:52.480 --> 37:54.400
Why do you look so unhappy?

37:58.920 --> 38:00.080
What's wrong?

38:00.160 --> 38:02.480
After you've done so much for her,

38:02.560 --> 38:04.400
she still won't accept you?

38:14.080 --> 38:17.240
I'm already in such a sorry state.

38:18.040 --> 38:19.360
Why should I care about the rain?

38:23.880 --> 38:25.600
In my father's eyes,

38:25.680 --> 38:29.400
I'm just as worthless
as you are in your grandfather's eyes.

38:31.040 --> 38:33.320
Now we're both infamous,

38:34.000 --> 38:35.520
abandoned by everyone.

38:37.680 --> 38:39.120
It seems

38:39.200 --> 38:42.160
only you and I in this world

38:42.240 --> 38:43.760
can truly understand this situation.

38:46.760 --> 38:47.920
We're tragic lovers.

38:51.480 --> 38:52.840
After going through so much,

38:54.360 --> 38:55.680
I realized

38:56.640 --> 38:58.720
the only one left by my side in the end

38:59.680 --> 39:00.720
is you.

39:07.720 --> 39:09.720
Sir, General Niu's men are here.

39:11.120 --> 39:12.800
Mr. Zhao, the General wants to see you.

39:12.880 --> 39:14.280
Come with me to the barracks.

39:17.080 --> 39:18.080
Dear,

39:18.160 --> 39:19.880
I'll change into some new clothes.

39:37.760 --> 39:40.640
My father only wants to see him?

39:40.720 --> 39:41.880
Madam,

39:41.960 --> 39:43.800
the General only mentioned Mr. Zhao.

39:43.880 --> 39:44.880
He didn't mention you.

39:57.880 --> 39:59.920
Zhao Xiuyuan, are you looking to die?

40:02.160 --> 40:04.360
- I don't dare.
- I see you dare quite a lot!

40:05.480 --> 40:07.720
You collaborated with Yang Jinglan to
escort the Logistics Officer to Chang'an.

40:07.800 --> 40:09.080
What's the meaning of that?

40:09.720 --> 40:11.480
Do you want to bring me down too?

40:11.560 --> 40:12.400
General, you got me wrong.

40:13.440 --> 40:15.080
I went to Chang'an with them

40:15.920 --> 40:17.640
to get close to Yang Jinglan

40:18.560 --> 40:19.920
and find an opportunity

40:21.040 --> 40:21.960
to kill and silence.

40:23.760 --> 40:25.200
How can I trust you?

40:25.280 --> 40:26.800
I killed the logistics officer.

40:27.560 --> 40:30.720
Now, I am at odds
with Yang Jinglan and Ji Yingying.

40:30.800 --> 40:34.800
Isn't this enough
to prove my loyalty, General?

40:36.560 --> 40:38.480
The logistics officer was my man.

40:39.160 --> 40:40.840
You acted on your own.

40:40.920 --> 40:42.160
Don't you fear angering me?

40:42.240 --> 40:43.640
He was once your man,

40:45.320 --> 40:48.280
but once he was captured,
he became your enemy.

40:49.040 --> 40:51.160
Yang Jinglan tried everything

40:51.240 --> 40:52.280
to make him change sides.

40:52.360 --> 40:54.520
He could betray you at any moment.

40:55.160 --> 40:56.160
So,

40:57.480 --> 41:00.240
the only way to keep him loyal to us

41:01.480 --> 41:03.000
is to make him stay silent forever.

41:13.160 --> 41:14.080
Stand up.

41:24.400 --> 41:27.120
I once thought
you were weak and incapable,

41:27.200 --> 41:28.440
but I never expected

41:28.520 --> 41:31.040
you would have such courage and resolve.

41:32.280 --> 41:34.200
Since you've done something so big for me,

41:34.280 --> 41:36.360
why didn't you send someone to inform me?

41:36.440 --> 41:38.840
This was always my responsibility.

41:38.920 --> 41:40.320
Why seek praise?

41:42.240 --> 41:43.520
In the end,

41:43.600 --> 41:44.800
this matter

41:44.880 --> 41:47.280
was caused by my useless daughter.

41:48.200 --> 41:50.600
Since you have such bravery and wisdom,

41:50.680 --> 41:52.720
in the future,
you should support her more.

41:59.880 --> 42:00.840
I cannot do it.

42:01.640 --> 42:03.320
Is it that you don't want to

42:03.400 --> 42:05.160
or that you cannot?

42:07.200 --> 42:09.440
No one understands her better than you.

42:10.240 --> 42:12.160
This time, she took a great risk.

42:12.240 --> 42:14.360
Fortunately, I was right beside her

42:14.440 --> 42:16.280
and managed to mediate.

42:16.360 --> 42:18.800
If she continues to act recklessly,

42:19.480 --> 42:21.000
the consequences will be unimaginable.

42:31.200 --> 42:33.400
You're trying to drive a wedge between us?

42:34.200 --> 42:36.720
I was just kindly reminding you.

42:40.240 --> 42:42.120
Tell me. What do you want?

42:42.720 --> 42:45.120
This time, I have already proven

42:45.200 --> 42:47.280
my loyalty and ability to you.

42:48.080 --> 42:50.000
I seek nothing else.

42:50.080 --> 42:52.200
I just want to continue serving you

42:52.280 --> 42:53.400
to protect both families

42:54.040 --> 42:57.520
and fulfill the duties
of a husband and a son-in-law.

42:59.200 --> 43:01.560
So, you want to take
her place and seize power?
